      "type": "aa-text-media",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "The studio",
        "heading": "A studio for craft and interiors",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "body": "<p>Artisan Atlas is a design studio working directly with artisan groups. We develop contemporary pieces with them, rooted in the techniques and materials each group already uses.</p><p>We make them for shops, hotels, restaurants and the people who design their spaces. Founded in the UK in 2024, we are beginning in Oaxaca, Mexico.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "button-secondary",
