    "founder": {
      "type": "aa-text-media",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Founder",
        "heading": "Maria-Belem Woodford",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "body": "<p>A former software engineer turned creative entrepreneur, Maria-Belem founded Artisan Atlas to connect craftsmanship with contemporary living, and to help keep cultural heritage alive through design.</p><p>She works directly with each workshop, in Spanish, English and German.</p>",
